Breaks the check of fuzz/fuzz_transport.c:468 (the queue and the frame builder both stop refusing F0 13 xx 70, so two commands make one).
Caught by the seed input "split-system" of fuzz_transport.

diff --git a/src/diginet_frame.c b/src/diginet_frame.c
